<title>USA: Stanton nominated as National Park Service chief.</title>
<headline>Stanton nominated as National Park Service chief.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Clinton has nominated Robert Stanton to be the next director of the National Park Service, the agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>If confirmed by the Senate, Stanton would be the first African-American to head the park service.</p>
<p>He retired last January after 30 years with the agency, where he was national capital regional director in his last eight years.</p>
